  "ALL_TEXT": "89 INT. POLICE STATION - DAY \nVEDA and BHANU nervously walk into the police station. VEDA \nenters slowly, looking to take as much time as he can to \nsurvey things. INUMAYYA is sitting on the Police station \nfloor and is talking to VEERAYYA. \nINUMAYYA \nPoddunnunchi kusobettindru sukka \nlekapothe manaku nadavadhu sir! \ninkenthasepu kurchovaali \nVEERAYYA \nEntra nee gola...ayyagarochindhaaka \nsilent gaa kurcho \nINUMAYYA \nAa ayyagaaru eppudosthaadu , nannu \neppudu vodulthaadu , nenu sukka \neppudu thagale...sukka lekunda \nkoosoni koosoni boru koduthundi sir \nVEERAYYA \nBokkalu iragadeesthaaara \nsaradhaaga... borukottadhu neeku \nINUMAYYA \nChee... nee yavva... savagodthundu. \nVEDA and BHANU notice INUMAYYA, when they are stopped in \ntheir tracks by a stern-faced VEERAYYA. At this moment, \nANTHONY walks in. \nVEERAYYA \n(to BHANU and VEDA) \nKurchondi, vasthaanu \nBHANU and VEDA are about to turn around and leave, when \nVEERAYYA notices INUMAYYA \nVEERAYYA \n(to INUMAYYA) \nYera, ekkadiki \nINUMAYYA showing his little finger to VEERAYYA. \nINUMAYYA \nUrgent saar mast urgent \nVEERAYYA \nPo.. Po \nCUT TO:",
